# Design & Motion Agent Rules — VFPScanner Web

- Source of truth: `docs/BRAND.md` (colours, type, spacing, voice)
- Colours only via tokens in `@theme`; light and dark both defined
- Motion library: `motion` (Framer Motion). Animate only `transform` and `opacity`
- Every animation has a `prefers-reduced-motion` fallback (static final state)
- Nothing animated may delay LCP — hero text renders first, scene animates after
- Motion components live in `components/motion/` and are Client Components; sections stay Server Components and import them
- No autoplay sound; no scroll-jacking; no parallax that moves text
- Mobile first; 16px side gutter; no horizontal scroll at 360px
- WCAG 2.2 AA contrast; visible focus rings

*Design & Motion Agent Rules — VFPScanner Web v0.1.0*
